    "body": "Back to draft: #408 (#320 stock source) restructured `entry()` into `carry_turn()` + a stock-source match, and that conflicts with this branch in `stock_sim_carry.rs`. Resolved by keeping #408's structure and moving #404's `one_machine` check into `carry_turn()`, so the carry reads the two setups' machine and never the active setup's. The program walk's per-change `one_machine` check still runs before the entry match, so it now also covers #408's `NewBlock` entry: the program sim judges one machine's program, matching #343's one-mount post law. `setup_carry` 8/8, `rest_across_setups` and `stock_sim_document` pass. Re-gating, then flagging ready again.",
